# rihla's ripgrep defaults, shared by the shell (rihla shell exports RIPGREP_CONFIG_PATH
# to this file when you have not set one) and the editor (its grep and live grep).
# One flag per line, as ripgrep reads it. The names below are the same as in fdignore.
# Search hidden files too, follow symlinks, ignore case unless the pattern has a capital,
# and never show a minified line in full. `rg --no-config` searches without these.
--smart-case
--hidden
--follow
--max-columns=300
--max-columns-preview
--glob=!.git/
--glob=!.hg/
--glob=!.svn/
--glob=!node_modules/
--glob=!.venv/
--glob=!__pycache__/
--glob=!.mypy_cache/
--glob=!.pytest_cache/
--glob=!.ruff_cache/
--glob=!.tox/
--glob=!.direnv/
--glob=!.DS_Store
